{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4aa1e96c651b8f44c1c55965caf2827d6af56b6ed4718568164e2c6506377552","ja":"真夏の女子トーク～1通目～","zh":"盛夏女生闲聊～第1封～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b4221fc277d60e6224f073740062844b98a4d94b5950ddbaaa07cd6f7b811122","ja":"番組をみているみんな、こんにちはっ♪　今日は\n私達4人が、みんなからいただいた質問に答えるわね♪","zh":"正在观看节目的大家，你们好♪　今天就由我们4人来回答大家提出的问题哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"904dc8c8bdc17c800eeae8af7946a516bcb703e63fd1edca510356953709b031","ja":"事前にメールを募集したところ、たくさん\n質問をいただきました。ありがとうございます！","zh":"事先征集邮件后，我们收到了许多问题。谢谢大家！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"32c13c72436ef120a024628ea07414def87a69de3f59e72a18174417a3e73fda","ja":"それじゃ、最初のメールから。\n『新曲にまつわる思い出はありますか？』ですって。","zh":"那么，就先看第一封邮件吧。\n『关于新曲有什么回忆吗？』上面是这么写的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2adc49d81a86f2e444df938f01083c5b4f1a479e031f080f00a4fa5709f20efa","ja":"そうね。語りたいことはたくさんあるけど……\n琴葉ちゃんは何かある？","zh":"也是呢。想说的话有很多，不过……\n琴叶，你有什么想说的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a66a6e6b50657cd51d192aabc09a03912bb894f0e4dc4f0738438e1d745b845c","ja":"私は、みんなで合宿をしたことですね。\n曲を理解するために、いろいろな特訓をしたんですよ。","zh":"我的话，是大家一起集训的那次吧。为了理解这首曲子，做了各种特训呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b383a11ae4faf491171a6cb8f3992603d5e70d8051efd6b2c2d79fa15bd7063e","ja":"海に向かって大声で叫んでみたりして……。\nふふっ。とっても新鮮で楽しかったです！","zh":"朝着大海大声喊了喊……。\n呵呵。真的很新鲜，很开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4dc462b0784be2826595356d9bcb537f451248bb515035ac08b2c581a4bd52bb","ja":"私は、みんなで行ったエステかな。\nとっても気持ちがよくて、すごく癒やされました。","zh":"我的话，应该是大家一起去做的那次美容护理吧。\n感觉特别舒服，身心都得到了治愈。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6c9478b380bd51a61e0574e9cf103405168d5702014f6cf16f61bfc0238137f8","ja":"真美は、ぜーんぶ楽しかったよ！\nでもでも一番は……りおっちとしたヒミツの話かな♪","zh":"真美全都玩得很开心哦！\n不过不过最开心的还是……和莉绪说的秘密吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0a548f621fde7fe4e83215aa889c051d421d03c901353d8d490a996ffbb6ae80","ja":"へぇ～、どんなお話をしたのか気になるな～。","zh":"哦～，聊了些什么，真让人好奇～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8bb1e88d7da4a69a4de8e955c9f7991afa16f72a5afadbb63cdb86fef8d62219","ja":"ん～と、りおっちの友達がね……。","zh":"嗯～，莉绪的朋友……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"65550916c3080d4d5c88d4fc1002edfe794304112957b7004317a22a964215d5","ja":"わーっ！　ストーップ！！","zh":"哇——！停！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_924.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d5b6d833f18c9d160caeea56650afa89ac3a5d7647c0b3b84a558789036fb33f","ja":"……え、えーっと、みんな楽しい思い出ができた\nみたいね♪　さあ、次のメールに行きましょうか！","zh":"……啊、那个，看来大家都留下了开心的回忆呢♪\n那么，去看下一封邮件吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
